the following survey concentrates only on the contributions 
specifically taking into account the latter. 
%Some works presenting 
The most efficient implementations of the 
arithmetic circuits mod \fermn{} using  D1 representation are: 
adders \cite{Vergos20021389}, \cite{Vergos2010911},
