\begin{enumerate}
\item Fields $\speckey{smlp\_execution}$,  $\speckey{interface\_consistent}$ and $\speckey{model\_consistent}$
are common for each (witness, query) pair, and they provide status of the entire execution of SMLP.
\item The field  $\speckey{witness\_consistent}$ specifies result of witness consistency check \cref{form:certify:witness:model:consistency}
\item The field  $\speckey{witness\_feasible}$ specifies result of witness feasibility check \cref{form:gear:certify:feasibility}
