Quick command template for solving the MRC problem on a single machine:
\begin{equation}
\cmdline{\progmrc{} -i \emph{data.csv} -s \emph{data.spec} -t \emph{target/dir} -j 112 run}
\tag{$*$}\label{cmd:mrc}
