\begin{theorem}%[C-error]
\label{Theorem_UpperBoundCError}
Suppose the following assumptions holds: \emph{(i)} $\nabla l^i (\bOmega, \gamma)$ is $\ell'_f$-Lipschitz continuous for any data sample; \emph{(ii)} $l^i (\bOmega, \gamma)$ is $\ell_f$-Lipschitz continuous for any data sample.
