We can then follow the same line as \cite{chen2023three} and prove the G-error has the following upper bound $\cE_G \le 4 \epsilon + \sqrt{\frac{V}{D}}$, %  develop the relation between the upper bound of generalization error in (\ref{E_G}) and uniform stability as follows:
% \begin{eqnarray}
