This visualization provides a clear and concise overview of the scheduling process, allowing users to easily identify areas of improvement and optimize their scheduling strategy.
Additionally, a \emph{@vis.js/Network} visualization is used to illustrate the dependencies between jobs, providing a comprehensive understanding of the scheduling problem.
