\subsection{Resource Allocation Optimizer}
\label{sec:optimizer}
To further minimize the impact of fine-grain spatial partitioning, ECLIP assigns resources to \textit{groups of kernels}. ECLIP introduces a resource allocation optimizer that determines \textit{how many} CUs a group of kernels will be allocated, and \textit{when} to switch CU partitions (which determine how kernels are grouped). 


