\subsection{Impact of Message Size on Signature Performance}
The performance of signing and verification can depend on the size of the message being processed. Figures~\ref{fig:msg_size_impact_signing} and \ref{fig:msg_size_impact_verification} plot operation times against message size for selected representative algorithms on macOS.

