    Since $x$ is a prefix of $y$ we have $\infixrank(u,y)\leq\infixrank(u,x)$.
    Also, $\kappa(q_y)=\infixrank(u,y)$ and $\kappa(q_x)=\infixrank(u,x)$, as per \autoref{def:Pu}. Then $\kappa(q_y)=\infixrank(u,y)\leq\infixrank(u,x)=\kappa(q_x)$.
