% We use LLMs to generate postconditions and find many postconditions generated by LLMs are incorrect.
% Our insight is that a few example inputs and expected outputs (in short as I/O examples in the rest of this paper) can detect incorrect postconditions, and developers can easily write a few I/O examples.
% Note that these I/O examples cannot directly be used to detect incorrect assertions. 
