Building upon prior concerns surrounding LLM-enabled cyber threats, Beckerich \textit{et al.} in \cite{beckerich2023ratgpt} examine LLMs as malware proxies. Their POC shows ChatGPT enabling covert command and control (C2) communication through plugin exploitation.
