		 = \sum_{S \subseteq Y \setminus T}\sum_{S \subseteq Q \subseteq S  \cup T} (-1)^{r(Q)}\ind_Q 
		= \sum_{S \subseteq Y \setminus T}(-1)^{r(S)}\al{S,S \cup T}. \]

