$\mathcal{G}_{t}(\mathcal{N},\mathcal{E}_{t})$ denotes a directed network, where $\mathcal{N}=\{1,\cdots,N\}$ represents the set of agents and $\mathcal{E}_{t}\subseteq\mathcal{N}\times\mathcal{N}$ signifies the edge set at time $t$.
