$\widehat{Q}_{i,t}(\bm{z})=\widehat{Q}_{i}\big(\bm{z};W_{i}(t)\big)$, $\overline{W}(t)=(1/N)\sum_{i=1}^{N}W_{i}(t)$, $\delta^{k}_{0,i}(t)=\widehat{Q}_{0}\big(\bm{z};W_{i}(t)\big)-(1-\gamma)r_{i}(\bm{z})-\gamma\widehat{Q}_{0}\big(\bm{z}';W_{i}(t)\big)$, $\delta^{k}_{0,\mathrm{ave}}(t)=\widehat{Q}_{0}\big(\bm{z};\overline{W}(t)\big)-(1-\gamma)\bar{r}(\bm{z})-\gamma\widehat{Q}_{0}\big(\bm{z}';\overline{W}(t)\big)$, and $\delta^{k*}_{0,\mathrm{ave}}=\widehat{Q}_{0}\big(\bm{z};W_{k}^{*}\big)-(1-\gamma)\bar{r}(\bm{z})-\gamma\widehat{Q}_{0}\big(\bm{z}';W_{k}^{*}\big)$.
