%The proof can be found in Appendix~\ref{theproofofStochasticDescentLemma}.
%\end{proof}
\par
Lemma~\ref{StochasticDescentLemma} establishes the stochastic descent of the average parameter $\overline{W}(t)$.
The detailed proof can be found in Appendix~\ref{theproofofStochasticDescentLemma}.
