Define $\delta^{\bm{\theta}}_{k}=\big((\delta^{\bm{\theta}}_{1,k})^{\top},\cdots,(\delta^{\bm{\theta}}_{N,k})^{\top}\big)^{\top}$ with the $i$-th element obeying
\begin{align}
