\underline{For (iii) of Lemma \ref{Lemma4-6}:}
According to the definitions of $\bar{g}^{k}_{\mathrm{ave}}(t)$ in (\ref{thedefinitionofstochastic-4}), $\bar{g}^{k*}_{0,\mathrm{ave}}$ in (\ref{thedefinitionofstochastic2-1}), and $\bar{g}^{k}_{0,\mathrm{ave}}(t)$ in (\ref{thedefinitionofstochastic2-3}), we have
