\par
For the $\mathrm{(iii)}$-th term in (\ref{firstinequalitythelemmaofbargave}), according to the definition of $\bar{g}^{k*}_{0,\mathrm{ave}}$ in (\ref{thedefinitionofstochastic2-1}), we have
