where (\ref{2thirdinequalitythelemmaofbargave}) follows from the (iii) of Fact~\ref{thefactinpaper}, (\ref{4thirdinequalitythelemmaofbargave}) and (\ref{thirdinequalitythelemmaofbargave}) are obtained from (vi) and (ii) of Fact~\ref{thefactinpaper}, respectively.
