Substituting (\ref{firstinequalitythelemmaofbargave1-1}), (\ref{secondinequalitythelemmaofbargave}), and (\ref{thirdinequalitythelemmaofbargave}) into (\ref{firstinequalitythelemmaofbargave}), we have
